    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "Since the Petitioner seeks bail for offence U/S. 376(3) of IPC and Sec. 4(2) of POCSO Act, the Informant/victim is required to be noticed/informed in view the provision of Section 439(1A) of Cr.P.C and Sub-rule 13 and 15 (viii) of Rule-4 of the Protection of Children from Sexual Offences Rules, 2020 (in short the \"Rules\").\n3. For the purpose of notice to the informant and information of victim-child in terms of the above provision of Cr.P.C & Rules, let the copy of the bail application received by the learned counsel for the State be sent to the informant/victim by Mr. K.K. Gaya, learned ASC through concerned Police Station indicating therein the probable date of hearing.\n4. List this matter in the week commencing 2nd September, 2024.",
